1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:06,390
That night was the Millennium. Our
compound was full of light.

2
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:12,930
As Grandmother brewed coffee in the
jebena, its smell filled the house.

3
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:17,800
Mother laid out a special meal for the
celebration.

4
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:24,730
The children ran around the courtyard,
laughing.

5
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:31,780
When Uncle told a joke, everyone burst
out laughing.

6
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:40,150
Father lit a candle, and everyone
watched in silence.

7
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:45,170
As the new era arrived, we all embraced.

8
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:50,810
Fireworks lit up the sky.

9
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:58,930
That night, we were all together.

10
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:06,470
Even today, that laughter still echoes
in our hearts.

